{"title": "Sacred Flame (Condition)", "pageid": 52784, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Sacred_Flame_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status groups", "Conditions with shared stack IDs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Sacred_Flame\" title=\"Sacred Flame\">Sacred Flame</a>        </div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Branding Smite Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Sacred Flame</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>The affected entity sheds light in 1.5m radius. It cannot become <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(Condition)\" title=\"Invisible (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Invisible\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(Condition)\" title=\"Invisible (Condition)\">Invisible</a>. Enemies are more likely to target this character during the trial. </li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BRANDING_SMITE</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CBRANDING_SMITE%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CBRANDING_SMITE%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/38px-Plus_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Status groups\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\">Status groups</a>: <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Light\" title=\"SG Light\">SG_Light</a></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This condition is inflicted only while undergoing the Trial of Courage in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Wyrmway\" title=\"The Wyrmway\">The Wyrmway</a>, after picking up the <a href=\"/wiki/Cemetery-Blue_Torch\" title=\"Cemetery-Blue Torch\">Cemetery-Blue Torch</a></li>\n<li>The condition lasts 4 turns, ending early if the battle is resolved or if the affected character is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Downed_(Condition)\" title=\"Downed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"downed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Downed_(Condition)\" title=\"Downed (Condition)\">downed</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dead_(Condition)\" title=\"Dead (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Dead_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Dead_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Dead_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"killed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Dead_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dead_(Condition)\" title=\"Dead (Condition)\">killed</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>BRANDING_SMITE</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Branding_Smite\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Branding_Smite_(Condition)\" title=\"Branding Smite (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Branding Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Branding_Smite_(Condition)\" title=\"Branding Smite (Condition)\">Branding Smite</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Cannot turn <a href=\"/wiki/Condition#Invisible\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition\">Invisible</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Sacred_Flame\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sacred_Flame_(Condition)\" title=\"Sacred Flame (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sacred Flame\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Sacred Flame</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>The affected entity sheds light in 1.5m radius. It cannot become <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(Condition)\" title=\"Invisible (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Invisible\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(Condition)\" title=\"Invisible (Condition)\">Invisible</a>. Enemies are more likely to target this character during the trial.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203343\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.069 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.075 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2350/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 22611/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7312/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.026/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1284554/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   63.133      1 -total\n 98.63%   62.269      1 Template:Condition_page\n 43.06%   27.182      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 25.45%   16.069      3 Template:Cond\n 19.86%   12.537      7 Template:Icon_link\n 19.04%   12.018      1 Template:PageSeo\n 18.72%   11.816      7 Template:Icon_text\n 16.34%   10.313     22 Template:Trim\n 16.04%   10.128      5 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 11.38%    7.186      2 Template:Condition_sources\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:52784-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714203343 and revision id